window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>In a world where nothing is certain, will two beings be able to change how they're seen?<br> <br> Arrow is a strong she-wolf who is used to doing things alone...until she meets Rivin Demonte. <br> <br> Rivin is a male vampire who understands the meaning of family and working as a team. When he meets Arrow, everything changes for him, and he is not willing to let her go without a fight.<br> <br> Get ready for this dark romance that will have you at the edge of your seat, begging for more.</p>"; 
